A game that is in Pixel Art style and 2D but cutscenes are in 3D high quality and it is a Backrooms Game with Levels and a Story

Main Character:
	- Name: Eugene
	- Job:  Cave Diver

Inventory:
	- Main Inventory:
		* 5 Useable Slots
		* 15-25 Unusable Slots
	- Armor:
		* Head
		* Chest
		* Leggings
		* Boots
		* Gloves
	
Game Mechaniks:
	- WASD to move: Front-view
	- Space to Jump
	- Shift for sprinting with stamina
	- Ctrl for crouching with seeability meter (How fast a entity can spot the player)
	- Sanity in multiple blocks and when on 0% goes crazy and dies (to fill "mendal water"-bottles)
	- in cutscenes and in some chapters it is in FPS in 3D
	- healthbar
	- multiple levels
	- respawn points with a save zone/area
	- when dies:
		* in a new "level" where to find the right door to go back when opening the wrong door -1 of the 3 tries and when on 0 tries and 
		didn't right door opened complete game over or timeout is 0 seconds (default is around 2 minutes max)

Items:
	- mendal-water-bottles: refill 2 blocks of the sanity and 5% more health
	- energy drink: disables stamina for a few seconds
	- chocolate bar: refills 20-50% of health

Enemys:
	- new entitys every level/chapter

Story:
	- prehistory:
		The main character is cave diving in the "Cane" cave when he discovers a new passage. He dives into this new passage and stumbles
		upon an old, abandoned laboratory where the name "M.E.G." is visible everywhere and the word "EXIT" is written in red on the walls. 
		He ventures deeper and enters the lab. There, he finds an area cordoned off with tape and intends to enter it. Suddenly, he falls 
		through the floor and drops into a mysterious place. 

Other:
	- None for now
